{"ID":"20240205165637-n3ku5nn","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205165637-n3ku5nn","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205165637-n3ku5nn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206095221-2mv8sie\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611095911-s63iymv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240621124454-lbfjeqt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:8\u0026#125;","title":"132大枣","type":"doc","updated":"20240812083512"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206095221-2mv8sie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095221-2mv8sie","updated":"20240206095228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于山西、陕西、河北、河南等地区。\n【性状】\t本品呈椭圆形或球形，长23.5cm，直径1.52.5cm。表面暗红色，略带光泽，有不规则皱纹。基部凹陷，有短果梗。外果皮薄，中果皮棕黄色或淡褐色，肉质，柔软，富糖性而油润。果核纺锤形，两端锐尖，质坚硬。气微香，味甜。\n【性味】\t甘，温。\n【功效】\t补中益气，养血安神。用于脾虚食少，乏力便溏，妇人脏躁。"}]},{"ID":"20240206095222-w7403s8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095222-w7403s8","updated":"20240206095222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206095222-19wh2g4.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165733-t1h6tf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205165733-t1h6tf8","updated":"20240812081345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大枣"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大枣-20240205165733-fbw3l8t.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240812082843-jqe79n5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240812082843-jqe79n5","updated":"20240812082843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 510px;","style":"width: 500px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240621124615-1sbf256.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 500px;\" parent-style=\"width: 510px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240621124533-bnh0254","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240621124533-bnh0254","updated":"20240812081400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 542px;","style":"width: 532px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240621124533-l5r362t.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 532px;\" parent-style=\"width: 542px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 547px;","style":"width: 537px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240621125027-z2vie54.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 537px;\" parent-style=\"width: 547px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240812082038-guit4gm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240812082038-guit4gm","updated":"20240812082819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"wid